#>texture_pewter
#:material #!metal

~pewter[metal]{brushed direction, hammered dimples, patina}

// the studio's standing look, so the file opens on texture.website as the line it would make
~pewter[close, overcast, handled, as-found](wall)<tile>

word: "pewter"
science: "Crystals of metal, worked by hammer, roller or brush; the surface keeps every tool's direction, and air adds its own colour as patina."
